@startuml
title application/json (default) - write
actor Application as App
participant ConsumedThing as CT
participant "JsonCodec\n(core, generic)" as J
participant "binding-opcua" as B
database "OPC UA server" as Srv
App -> CT : writeProperty("setpoint", 42)
CT -> J : valueToContent(42, "application/json")
J --> CT : bytes "42"
CT -> B : writeResource(form, Content)
B -> Srv : read the node's DataType
Srv --> B : Double
note over B : parse "42" -> Variant Double 42\nInt64 accepted as a string,\nByteString as base64
B -> Srv : Write
Srv --> B : Good
B --> App : done

note over App, Srv
  the same write, for three harder types

  ByteString DE AD BE EF
    application/json                 : "3q2+7w=="
    opcua+json;type=Variant          : {"Type":15,"Body":"3q2+7w=="}
    opcua+json;type=Variant;version=1.05 : {"UaType":15,"Value":"3q2+7w=="}
    application/octet-stream         : the four bytes themselves

  ByteString[] [01 02] and [03]
    application/json                 : ["AQI=","Aw=="]  (stores the base64 text, not the bytes)
    opcua+json;type=Variant          : {"Type":15,"Body":["AQI=","Aw=="]}  (round-trips)
    application/octet-stream         : refused, a raw stream cannot frame several

  ExtensionObject (Argument)
    application/json                 : {"Name":"Arg1","DataType":{"Id":6},...}  (no type identity)
    opcua+json;type=Variant          : {"Type":22,"Body":{"TypeId":{"Id":296},"Body":{...}}}
    opcua+json;type=Variant;version=1.05 : {"UaType":22,"Value":{"UaTypeId":"i=296","UaBody":{...}}}
end note

@enduml
